## Architecture Flow

```
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 1. Key Lifecycle & Evergreen Build Pipeline                                       |
|    [Airflow Monthly DAG] --> Generate Key N+1 / Write to Vault KV-v2 (Max=3)      |
|             |                                                                     |
|             +--(Trigger)---+                                                      |
|                            v                                                      |
|    [Bi-Weekly Evergreen / CVE Rebuild] --> [GitLab CI/CD Pipeline]                |
|                                                    |                              |
|                                                    +--> Fetch active key from KV  |
|                                                    +--> go build -ldflags "-s -w" |
|                                                    +--> Rolling deploy sender     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| 2. Sender One-Time Startup (Go)                                                   |
|    - Parse & zero raw key memory -> Init AES-256-GCM                              |
|    - Read fresh Projected K8s JWT from volume mount (/var/run/secrets/...)        |
|    - Generate 12-byte random Nonce                                                |
|    - Compute AAD: [kid + SHA256(JWT)]                                             |
|    - Encrypt: gcm.Seal(nil, nonce, plaintext, AAD)                                |
|    - Send Single HTTP POST (Headers: Auth Bearer, X-Key-Version) ------------->+  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-+
                                                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------v-+
| 3. Single Receiver Workflow (Go)                                                  |
|    a. Verify JWT signature via K8s JWKS & verify |Now - iat| <= 120s              |
|    b. Dedup Lock: TryAcquire(claims["jti"], TTL=120s) -> 409 Conflict if seen     |
|    c. Keychain Lookup: Match `X-Key-Version` against memory cache [N-2, N]        |
|    d. Reconstruct AAD: [kid + SHA256(JWT)]                                        |
|    e. GCM Decrypt: gcm.Open(nil, nonce, ciphertext+tag, AAD)                      |
|    f. Return Secret Bootstrap Material & HTTP 200 OK                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

```

